#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Critical concepts {#critical-concepts}"
msgstr "Konsep penting {#critical-concepts}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qubits can be entangled, meaning a measurement of one qubit affects or even "
"determines the state of another qubit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qubit boleh dibelit, bermakna pengukuran satu qubit mempengaruhi atau bahkan"
" menentukan keadaan qubit lain.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Entanglement differs from classical correlations; for example, qubits A and "
"B could be in a superposition of states like "
"$\\alpha_0|00\\rangle+\\alpha_1|11\\rangle.$ The state of A or B could be "
"undetermined by nature, and yet A and B could still be guaranteed to be in "
"the same state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Belitan berbeza daripada korelasi klasik; contohnya, qubit A dan B boleh "
"berada dalam superposisi keadaan seperti "
"$\\alpha_0|00\\rangle+\\alpha_1|11\\rangle.$ Keadaan A atau B mungkin tidak "
"ditentukan oleh alam, namun A dan B masih dijamin berada dalam keadaan yang "
"sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Through a combination of entanglements and measurements, we can transfer a "
"state (which can store information) from one qubit to another. This transfer"
" can even be done over long distances, and this is called quantum "
"teleportation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Melalui gabungan belitan dan pengukuran, kita boleh memindahkan keadaan "
"(yang boleh menyimpan maklumat) dari satu qubit ke qubit lain. Pemindahan "
"ini bahkan boleh dilakukan merentasi jarak jauh, dan ini dipanggil "
"teleportasi kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum teleportation relies on quantum measurements, which are "
"probabilistic. Thus, classical communication can be necessary to tweak the "
"teleported states. This prevents quantum teleportation from moving "
"information faster than light. Quantum teleportation does not violate "
"relativity or causality.\n"
msgstr ""
"Teleportasi kuantum bergantung pada pengukuran kuantum, yang bersifat "
"kebarangkalian. Oleh itu, komunikasi klasik mungkin diperlukan untuk "
"melaraskan keadaan yang diteleportasi. Ini menghalang teleportasi kuantum "
"daripada memindahkan maklumat lebih laju daripada cahaya. Teleportasi "
"kuantum tidak melanggar relativiti atau sebab-musabab.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Modern quantum computers are more susceptible to noise and errors than "
"classical computers. Expect a few percent error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komputer kuantum moden lebih terdedah kepada hingar dan ralat berbanding "
"komputer klasik. Jangkakan ralat beberapa peratus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The more gates you add in sequence (especially 2-qubit gates) the more "
"errors and noise you can expect.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lebih banyak gate yang anda tambah secara berurutan (terutamanya gate "
"2-qubit), lebih banyak ralat dan hingar yang boleh dijangkakan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "True/False questions {#truefalse-questions}"
msgstr "Soalan Betul/Salah {#truefalse-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F Quantum teleportation can be used to send information faster than "
"light.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Teleportasi kuantum boleh digunakan untuk menghantar maklumat lebih laju"
" daripada cahaya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F Modern evidence suggests that the collapse of a quantum state propagates"
" faster than light.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Bukti moden mencadangkan bahawa keruntuhan keadaan kuantum merebak lebih"
" laju daripada cahaya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F In Qiskit, qubits are ordered in states with the lowest-numbered qubit "
"on the right, as in $|q_3,q_2,q_1, q_0\\rangle$\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Dalam Qiskit, qubit diatur dalam keadaan dengan qubit bernombor terendah"
" di sebelah kanan, seperti dalam $|q_3,q_2,q_1, q_0\\rangle$\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "MC questions {#mc-questions}"
msgstr "Soalan pelbagai pilihan {#mc-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qubits A and B are entangled, then separated by a great distance $d$. Qubit "
"A is measured. Which statement is correct about the speed at which the state"
" of qubit B is affected?\n"
msgstr ""
"Qubit A dan B dibelit, kemudian dipisahkan pada jarak jauh $d$. Qubit A "
"diukur. Pernyataan manakah yang betul tentang kelajuan keadaan qubit B "
"terpengaruh?\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a. Qubit B is affected instantly, within experimental tolerance, in "
"experiments run so far.\n"
msgstr ""
"a. Qubit B terpengaruh dengan serta-merta, dalam toleransi eksperimen, dalam"
" eksperimen yang dijalankan setakat ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"b. Qubit B is affected after a time $d/c$, meaning the quantum state "
"\"collapses\" at approximately the speed of light, within experimental "
"tolerance.\n"
msgstr ""
"b. Qubit B terpengaruh selepas masa $d/c$, bermakna keadaan kuantum "
"\"runtuh\" pada kira-kira kelajuan cahaya, dalam toleransi eksperimen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c. Qubit B is affected only after classical communication has occurred, "
"meaning it happens in a time longer than $d/c$.\n"
msgstr ""
"c. Qubit B terpengaruh hanya selepas komunikasi klasik berlaku, bermakna ia "
"berlaku dalam masa lebih panjang daripada $d/c$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "d. None of the above\n"
msgstr "d. Tiada satu pun di atas\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recall that measurement probability is related to amplitudes in quantum "
"states. For example, if a qubit is initially in the state "
"$\\alpha_0|0\\rangle+\\alpha_1 |1\\rangle,$ the probability of measuring the"
" state $|0\\rangle$ is $|\\alpha_0|^2.$ Not all sets of measurements will "
"exactly match these probabilities, due to finite sampling (just as flipping "
"a coin might yield heads twice in a row). The measurement histogram below "
"could correspond to which of the following quantum states? Select the best "
"option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ingat semula bahawa kebarangkalian pengukuran berkaitan dengan amplitud "
"dalam keadaan kuantum. Contohnya, jika qubit pada mulanya berada dalam "
"keadaan $\\alpha_0|0\\rangle+\\alpha_1 |1\\rangle,$ kebarangkalian mengukur "
"keadaan $|0\\rangle$ ialah $|\\alpha_0|^2.$ Tidak semua set pengukuran akan "
"tepat sepadan dengan kebarangkalian ini, disebabkan pensampelan terhingga "
"(sama seperti melempar syiling mungkin menghasilkan kepala dua kali "
"berturut-turut). Histogram pengukuran di bawah boleh sepadan dengan keadaan "
"kuantum yang mana? Pilih jawapan terbaik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![entangled_teleportation_fig](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-teleportation/entangled_teleportation_fig.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![entangled_teleportation_fig](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-teleportation/entangled_teleportation_fig.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "a. $|0\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "a. $|0\\rangle$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "b. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"
msgstr "b. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "c. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"
msgstr "c. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "d. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "d. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "e. $\\frac{3}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{4}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "e. $\\frac{3}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{4}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Which of the following states show(s) qubits A and B entangled? Select all "
"that apply.\n"
msgstr ""
"Antara keadaan berikut, yang manakah menunjukkan qubit A dan B dibelit? "
"Pilih semua yang berkenaan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a. "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"
msgstr ""
"a. "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "b. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A$\n"
msgstr "b. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c. "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A-|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"
msgstr ""
"c. "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A-|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"d. "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"
msgstr ""
"d. "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "e. $|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A$\n"
msgstr "e. $|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this module, we prepared an entangled state: "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right).$"
" But there are many other entangled states one could use for a similar "
"protocol. Which of the states below could yield a 2-qubit measurement "
"histogram like the following? Select the best response.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam modul ini, kita menyediakan keadaan belit: "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right).$"
" Tetapi terdapat banyak keadaan belit lain yang boleh digunakan untuk "
"protokol yang serupa. Antara keadaan di bawah, yang manakah boleh "
"menghasilkan histogram pengukuran 2-qubit seperti berikut? Pilih jawapan "
"terbaik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![entangled_teleportation_fig_0110](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-teleportation/entangled_teleportation_fig_0110.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![entangled_teleportation_fig_0110](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-teleportation/entangled_teleportation_fig_0110.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "d. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A$\n"
msgstr "d. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A$\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Discussion questions {#discussion-questions}"
msgstr "Soalan perbincangan {#discussion-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Describe the quantum teleportation protocol, from start to finish, to your "
"partner/group. See if they have anything to add, or if they have "
"questions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terangkan protokol teleportasi kuantum, dari awal hingga akhir, kepada "
"rakan/kumpulan anda. Lihat sama ada mereka ada sesuatu untuk ditambah, atau "
"jika mereka ada soalan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Is there anything unique about the initial entangled state between Alice and"
" Bob: "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right)?$"
" If so, what is unique about it? If not, what other entangled states could "
"we have used?\n"
msgstr ""
"Adakah terdapat sesuatu yang unik tentang keadaan belit awal antara Alice "
"dan Bob: "
